{"id":"n89458-7-6","stage":1,"title":"굵다 · 粗","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n89458-7-6-1","ko":"올이 굵은 스웨터에는 보풀이 잘 생기는 것 같아.","zh":"我觉得毛线较粗的毛衣很容易起球呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"올이","meaning":"今年","explanation":"올：今年；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"올","audio":"/audio/d4e5ba0f9d89e82785b6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22072","senseId":"1","lemma":"올","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"올이","audio":"/audio/171d04644b64194dcdde.mp3"}},{"text":"굵은","meaning":"粗，粗糙","explanation":"굵다：粗，粗糙；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"굵다","audio":"/audio/f0e74315d7de77f237b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89458","senseId":"7","lemma":"굵다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"굵은","audio":"/audio/7295fa896d4e2c3eafa4.mp3"}},{"text":"스웨터에는","meaning":"毛衣","explanation":"스웨터：毛衣；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"스웨터","audio":"/audio/8a2a6ac758011971cccf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65063","senseId":"1","lemma":"스웨터","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"스웨터에는","audio":"/audio/053692d90b31cf18b4c5.mp3"}},{"text":"보풀이","meaning":"毛，球","explanation":"보풀：毛，球；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"보풀","audio":"/audio/f69179460fed8dba6b04.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"92533","senseId":"1","lemma":"보풀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보풀이","audio":"/audio/1123eb1dce1e087c1ef9.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"容易","explanation":"잘：容易","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"14","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"생기는","meaning":"有，出现","explanation":"생기다：有，出现；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"생기다","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67898","senseId":"1","lemma":"생기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생기는","audio":"/audio/b53fc58a70ea237d794c.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아","audio":"/audio/3eb21a4d72c48bbf26ae.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d4e5ba0f9d89e827","term":"올","zh":"今年","audio":"/audio/d4e5ba0f9d89e82785b6.mp3","entryId":"22072","definition":"现在正在度过的年。","pronunciation":["올"]},{"id":"f0e74315d7de77f2","term":"굵다","zh":"粗，粗糙","audio":"/audio/f0e74315d7de77f237b8.mp3","entryId":"89458","definition":"用不细的线编织，布十分粗涩。","pronunciation":["국ː따"]},{"id":"8a2a6ac758011971","term":"스웨터","zh":"毛衣","audio":"/audio/8a2a6ac758011971cccf.mp3","entryId":"65063","definition":"用毛线织成的厚厚的上衣。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"f69179460fed8dba","term":"보풀","zh":"毛，球","audio":"/audio/f69179460fed8dba6b04.mp3","entryId":"92533","definition":"在纸或布料的表面上起的细小的茸毛。","pronunciation":["보풀"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"容易","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"性质或倾向较易成为某种状态或进行某种行动地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"fc2a5a2e23bd6357","term":"생기다","zh":"有，出现","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3","entryId":"67898","definition":"新增了原本没有的东西。","pronunciation":["생기다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/c8a4fd53a0606fc43b41.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n89458-7-6-2","ko":"그래도 따뜻하고 포근하잖아.","zh":"不过它还是很暖和、很舒适的啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래도","meaning":"“그리하여도(即便如此)”的缩略语。","explanation":"그래도：“그리하여도(即便如此)”的缩略语。","readings":[{"term":"그래도","audio":"/audio/82bd547e58bb6509909c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36264","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래도","audio":"/audio/82bd547e58bb6509909c.mp3"}},{"text":"따뜻하고","meaning":"暖和","explanation":"따뜻하다：暖和；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"따뜻하다","audio":"/audio/e4840ad0903352f1e2e3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57297","senseId":"1","lemma":"따뜻하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"따뜻하고","audio":"/audio/d3f08b031b1ff0975b54.mp3"}},{"text":"포근하잖아.","meaning":"蓬软，松软，温暖","explanation":"포근하다：蓬软，松软，温暖；잖아：提醒对方已知的事实，非敬语：“不是……嘛”。","readings":[{"term":"포근하다","audio":"/audio/3fdaaf49768bc0c4efcd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83344","senseId":"1","lemma":"포근하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"포근하잖아","audio":"/audio/50185da714b0e683c24f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"82bd547e58bb6509","term":"그래도","zh":"“그리하여도(即便如此)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/82bd547e58bb6509909c.mp3","entryId":"36264","definition":"“그리하여도(即便如此)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"e4840ad0903352f1","term":"따뜻하다","zh":"暖和","audio":"/audio/e4840ad0903352f1e2e3.mp3","entryId":"57297","definition":"温度适中，不觉得太热，达到心情舒适的程度。","pronunciation":["따뜨타다"]},{"id":"3fdaaf49768bc0c4","term":"포근하다","zh":"蓬软，松软，温暖","audio":"/audio/3fdaaf49768bc0c4efcd.mp3","entryId":"83344","definition":"较厚的东西或位子柔软而暖和。","pronunciation":["포근하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/79e805a1c3fc503c4b21.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.636,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=89458","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"7","sourceLevel":"초급","day":52,"sequenceScore":2.2894,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["不过它还是很暖和、很舒适的啊。","我觉得毛线较粗的毛衣很容易起球呢。","我的腰太疼了。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我觉得毛线较粗的毛衣很容易起球呢。","我的腰太疼了。","不过它还是很暖和、很舒适的啊。"],"answer":2}]}
